# Instance data. This repository publishes the design of the platform, never an
# instance of it: hostnames, addresses, ntfy topics, ping URLs and tokens live
# outside git (ADR-006). The rules match the shape of a local file rather than
# one predicted name, because the copy someone actually saves is rarely spelled
# the way the rule expected.
/local/
*.local.*
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
